[ve:0.3.1]
[00:12.09]I saw the smoke
[00:15.72]Before the flame
[00:17.91]I stayed anyway
[00:24.36]They call it weakness
[00:27.44]To feel this deep
[00:29.92]They call it reckless
[00:33.05]To never sleep
[00:35.38]I learned the cost
[00:37.58]I read the signs
[00:39.17]I didn’t fall
[00:40.41]I crossed the line
[00:42.09]Don’t tell me I didn’t know
[00:44.96]Don’t tell me I was blind
[00:49.18]I saw the ending coming
[00:51.68]And still called it mine
[00:59.49]I knew the fire
[01:02.33]I chose the burn
[01:05.09]I knew the lesson
[01:07.76]I refused to learn
[01:10.70]If loving you breaks the sky
[01:13.88]Then let it fall on me
[01:16.95]I don’t need saving
[01:19.20]I need to be free
[01:22.84]They love the glow
[01:25.69]They fear the heat
[01:28.77]They want the beauty
[01:31.38]Without the teeth
[01:33.77]I never asked
[01:36.61]To come out clean
[01:39.27]I wanted truth
[01:41.89]Not something safe
[01:46.38]I don’t mistake pain for love
[01:49.23]I know the difference well
[01:51.85]But some truths
[01:53.63]Only live in hell
[01:57.88]I knew the fire
[02:00.64]I chose the flame
[02:03.77]I knew the ruin
[02:06.57]I said your name
[02:08.96]If this is how the world ends
[02:11.40]I’ll stand right here
[02:14.35]I don’t regret
[02:17.10]What cost me everything
[02:21.69]♫
[02:43.37]Don’t call me broken
[02:46.56]I’m awake
[02:47.82]Don’t call me lost
[02:49.22]This was my way
[02:50.72]I don’t survive
[02:52.22]By staying whole
[02:53.95]I survive
[02:55.03]By choosing my own role
[02:59.70]I knew the fire
[03:02.22]I chose to stay
[03:05.13]I knew the dark
[03:08.17]I didn’t pray
[03:10.00]If loving you is my last sin
[03:13.19]Then let it be
[03:16.07]I don’t want heaven
[03:20.18]I want honesty
[03:23.34]♫
[03:34.26]I knew.
[03:40.28]And I stayed.
